Package: mapzero
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DrB0rk <berk@berkderooij.nl>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-pil, nmap, fonts-dejavu-core
Homepage: https://github.com/DrB0rk/mapzero
Description: MapZero - network topology mapper for the Cardputer Zero
 Scans the local network with nmap, draws the discovered hosts and their open
 ports as a topology on the device screen, and saves scans as JSON for later.
 .
 Only scan networks you own or are authorised to test.
